e Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/wisconsin/vilas-county"],["ARC or PLC in Vilas County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/vilas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Vilas County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years, more often than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 56% of normal in October to November and 170% in February to March. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 74% and June to July at 73%. Grid 31062 had its driest year in 1976 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
